[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13804.63, "timestamp": "03:50:04", "text": "会有吗？ 10. 是的。和往常一样，10。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13807.67, "timestamp": "03:50:07", "text": "我不知道为什么恶魔们会发出这样的感叹"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13811.11, "timestamp": "03:50:11", "text": "哇。我的天哪，吓死我了。美好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13814.469, "timestamp": "03:50:14", "text": "美好的。简直就像“我的天哪”。美好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13816.68, "timestamp": "03:50:16", "text": "乔。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13818.229, "timestamp": "03:50:18", "text": "[掌声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13820.55, "timestamp": "03:50:20", "text": "一秒钟之内把整个游戏给我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13822.07, "timestamp": "03:50:22", "text": "快点。是的。所以，现在我们要走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13826.07, "timestamp": "03:50:26", "text": "我们要打开大门。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13828.63, "timestamp": "03:50:28", "text": "里面有房间和东西需要解锁。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13831.11, "timestamp": "03:50:31", "text": "我来拿着这些瓶子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13833.11, "timestamp": "03:50:33", "text": "好的。嘿，我要解锁鼓了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13839.99, "timestamp": "03:50:39", "text": "我可以把鸡蛋放在门附近吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13841.67, "timestamp": "03:50:41", "text": "那个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13844.389, "timestamp": "03:50:44", "text": "呃，蜘蛛还会再捡起来的。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13847.11, "timestamp": "03:50:47", "text": "不。哦，那我来拿着吧。好的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13848.87, "timestamp": "03:50:48", "text": "就像山羊一样。你不能喜欢持有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13852.469, "timestamp": "03:50:52", "text": "现场的祭祀用品。"}]